Learning -> Learning: tinh_sm2()
Learning -> DB: cap_nhat_tien_do_hoc()
Learning -> DB: ghi_lich_su_on_tap()
Learning --> ReviewRouter: ReviewResult
ReviewRouter --> App: ReviewResult
